type: txt
help: Identifier used by client to identify itself to the DHCP server
val_help: txt; DHCP option string
syntax:expression: exec "${vyos_libexec_dir}/validate-value --regex \'[-_a-zA-Z0-9.\\s]+\' --regex \'([a-fA-F0-9][a-fA-F0-9]:){2,}[a-fA-F0-9][a-fA-F0-9]\'   --value \'$VAR(@)\'"; "Invalid value"
